Z||000000||Monkeyman||02-18-2000||03:27 AM||||The Fierowarehouse <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierowarehouse</A> <BR>Doug Kinney, owner<P>Anybody ever heard of him?  He seems to have a wide selection of parts with fairly reasonable prices.  Even Indy and T-top parts.  Some of the prices are cheaper elsewhere, but it might be a good source.<P>Tom and Fierodave--He must know you two as you guys are his only links.  Have you ever dealt with him before or did he just get your URLs from the net?  Opinions?||||reg||1
