Z||000006||batboy||02-19-2000||09:38 AM||||I emailed him about a rebuildable 2.5 block he has setting around. He emailed me right back immediately. The price sounds very reasonable and he promised to send a couple of pics. The only thing is that he lives in Wheeling, WV. While this is close for you Ohio dudes, shipping costs for an engine block might be too much for me, but that's not his fault. Maybe I need to make a road trip this spring.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Monkeyman||02-19-2000||10:54 AM||||I'm still waiting for a response but the part I was interested in would only cost a few bucks, not millions like that block.  I'm sure he's gone for the weekend now.  I'll have to try again on Monday am.  <BR>Does anyone know if the background pic on his site is really what his warehouse looks like?  I imagine that's what Fierodaves garage looks like, too.  When I die and go to Heaven, I'm gonna have a garage like FD.||||reg||1
